@startuml
actor Lecturer
boundary MarkingPage
control MarkingController
control MarkingService
database Database
boundary NotificationService

Lecturer -> MarkingPage: Access marking interface
MarkingPage -> MarkingController: GET /api/marking/{studentId or projectId} to retrieve marking form
MarkingController -> MarkingService: Fetch marking form details
MarkingService -> Database: Retrieve student/project and marking scheme details
Database --> MarkingService: Return marking form details
MarkingService --> MarkingController: Return marking form details
MarkingController --> MarkingPage: Provide marking form for input

Lecturer -> MarkingPage: Input marks according to marking scheme
MarkingPage -> MarkingController: POST /api/marking/{studentId or projectId}/submit with marks and criteria
MarkingController -> MarkingService: Validate and process mark submission
MarkingService -> MarkingService: Validate marks and criteria
alt Marks and criteria are valid
    MarkingService -> Database: Save marks and update record
    Database --> MarkingService: Return save status
    alt Save succeeded
        MarkingService --> MarkingController: Confirm marks saved
        MarkingController --> MarkingPage: Notify success
        MarkingPage -> Lecturer: Display success message
        MarkingController -> NotificationService: Notify student of marks
        NotificationService -> Student: Send notification with marks and criteria
        NotificationService --> MarkingController: Return notification status
    else Save failed
        MarkingService --> MarkingController: Notify failure
        MarkingController --> MarkingPage: Display error message
        MarkingPage -> Lecturer: Display error message
    end
else Marks or criteria are invalid
    MarkingService --> MarkingController: Return validation errors
    MarkingController --> MarkingPage: Display validation errors
    MarkingPage -> Lecturer: Display validation errors
end

@enduml
